{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Kr7gLEdJe01795570548.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>山西博物院近日展出，兩組保存完好而且較為罕見的明代藏經櫃。</p><p></p><p>眼前這兩組明代藏經櫃，通體塗上朱漆，是山西太原崇善寺用於存放《大藏經》的藏經櫃。抽屜按《千字文》排序，一一對應經卷的位置。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SX.CABINET.1112-1125_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026c5RDp4qm7V1795570545.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>策展人安海表示：「每一函(經書)都保存在這樣一個抽屜當中，但是這個抽屜呢，它做得非常精緻，每個抽屜的拉環，它拉環的底下墊片是一枚我們的銅錢，是一枚『嘉靖通寶』。拉開裡面就是一函，一函大藏經應該是十冊。那麼在經櫃的面板上以《千字文》的形式，把大藏經都分開了。如果我們要找，比如說某一部大藏經的某一冊，那我們就從它的這個《千字文》的編號當中去對應。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SX.CABINET.1112-1125_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IYg0oVAre81795570542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>全套藏經櫃共有12組，約1,000個小方格抽屜，對應4,000多卷經書。山西博物院僅展出其中兩組，另外十組仍保存在崇善寺。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:23:55.480863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T01:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T17:57:39.961545+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T02:17:16.572980+00:00","content_hash":"5cd0257fab6cebccaf36a6f03d6f2c421f5ec9a4c6753129b40f5f5afe1d3a82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:23:55.480863+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}